* 2N2647 Precision Pulse UJT (Verified Fixed eta=0.70, Rbb=6.8k)
* Pinout: 1=Emitter, 2=Base1, 3=Base2
.subckt 2N2647 1 2 3
DE  1 4 EMITTER
VE  4 5 DC 0
HVE 6 0 VE 1K
